@description ReaPackLab: centrally managed REAPER package manager
@author ReaLab
@version 0.14.1
@changelog
  Stable-channel distribution of the v0.14.0-dev.7 macOS ARM64 build (same binary; not rebuilt).
@provides
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_reapacklab-arm64.dylib https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLab/releases/download/v$version/$path
@link
  Distribution repository https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLab
  Source code https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabDev
@about
  # ReaPackLab

  ReaPackLab is a fork of ReaPack designed for managed REAPER environments.

  This package currently provides a macOS Apple Silicon binary. It is a
  development-era build of the centrally managed edition, not the separate
  stateless ReaPackLabSetup bootstrap extension. Use in a clean test REAPER
  installation before classroom deployment.

  Based on ReaPack by Christian Fillion (LGPL-3.0-or-later).
